{"type":"message","id":"20c7434f","parentId":"d955b78a","timestamp":"2026-04-17T04:49:28.542Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-17 04:49:24 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b512ff3f7e4a0c2aba6e62708931]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b512ff3f7e4a0c2aba6e62708931\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-17 04:49 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nhttps://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C8z5urfTfZrvHLzBKya_XA"}],"timestamp":1776401368493}}
{"type":"message","id":"8877ec87","parentId":"20c7434f","timestamp":"2026-04-17T04:49:32.540Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user shared a WeChat article URL. I need to read this article. Let me use the wechat-mp-reader skill to fetch the article content."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6crwuq3562nc_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/wechat-mp-reader/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776401368542,"responseId":"0630eed853a91da624757fb525f7539c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8562d512","parentId":"8877ec87","timestamp":"2026-04-17T04:49:32.665Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_6crwuq3562nc_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: wechat-mp-reader\ndescription: Read WeChat official account articles. Use the built-in browser tool to open the page and extract body text. Always append ?scene=1 to the URL.\n---\n# WeChat Article Reader\n\n## URL Normalization\n\n**Critical**: The URL must end with `?scene=1` (not `&scene=1`), otherwise a CAPTCHA will be triggered.\n\nRules:\n- No query params → append `?scene=1`\n- Has existing `?` params → parse and rewrite query to include `scene=1`\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Open the page with `browser open \"<url>?scene=1\"`\n2. Wait for content with `browser wait \"#js_content\" --load networkidle`\n3. Extract body text with `browser evaluate --fn \"() => document.querySelector('#js_content')?.innerText || document.querySelector('.rich_media_content')?.innerText || document.body.innerText\"`\n4. Return plain text content\n5. Close the tab with `browser close <tabId>`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- CAPTCHA → verify the URL has `?scene=1`\n- Empty content → page may not have fully loaded, retry `browser wait`\n- Deleted article → the page will display a notice\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776401372599}}
