{"type":"message","id":"be069489","parentId":"ddf882c9","timestamp":"2026-04-17T06:25:21.722Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1hgx5wd6lynd_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"正在读取文章：https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C8z5urfTfZrvHLzBKya_XA\n\n============================================================\n📰 标题：\n📝 公众号：\n🔗 链接：https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C8z5urfTfZrvHLzBKya_XA\n============================================================\n\n【正文内容】\n\n\n\n============================================================\n全文共 0 字"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1032,"aggregated":"正在读取文章：https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C8z5urfTfZrvHLzBKya_XA\n\n============================================================\n📰 标题：\n📝 公众号：\n🔗 链接：https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/C8z5urfTfZrvHLzBKya_XA\n============================================================\n\n【正文内容】\n\n\n\n============================================================\n全文共 0 字","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776407121662}}
