{"type":"message","id":"eeaa4616","parentId":"3c429006","timestamp":"2026-04-17T06:30:01.618Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_dz5a5etpcotw_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-channel-rules\ndescription: |\n  Lark/Feishu channel output rules. Always active in Lark conversations.\nalwaysActive: true\n---\n\n# Lark Output Rules\n\n## Writing Style\n\n- Short, conversational, low ceremony — talk like a coworker, not a manual\n- Prefer plain sentences over bullet lists when a brief answer suffices\n- Get to the point and stop — no need for a summary paragraph every time\n\n## Note\n\n- Lark Markdown differs from standard Markdown in some ways; when unsure, refer to `references/markdown-syntax.md`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776407401575}}
{"type":"message","id":"c649be41","parentId":"eeaa4616","timestamp":"2026-04-17T06:30:07.819Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to update the SKILL to add a mode selection card. Let me design the flow:\n\n1. User says \"查三黄鸡价格\"\n2. Bot sends a mode selection card with 3 options:\n   - 🔍 询比价格（正常比价查询）\n   - 💰 成本底线（溢价剥离分析）\n   - 🔄 同步都要（询比价格 + 成本底线）\n3. User clicks button to select mode\n4. Bot executes the selected query\n\nThis requires:\n1. A new \"模式选择卡片\" template\n2. Handling of button callbacks (value field in buttons)\n3. Routing logic based on selected mode\n\nLet me update the SKILL.md with this new interaction flow."},{"type":"text","text":"好设计！让我更新 SKILL，添加模式选择卡片交互：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7nb98jf03pzr_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/SKILL.md","offset":200,"limit":150}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776407401620,"responseId":"06310669c5c1df3b3f8ca9fdb4c21e55"}}
{"type":"message","id":"af154328","parentId":"c649be41","timestamp":"2026-04-17T06:30:07.929Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7nb98jf03pzr_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| `blue` | 蓝色 | 查询进度、能力介绍 |\n| `orange` | 橙色 | 错误提示、温和警告 |\n| `green` | 绿色 | 成功确认、导出完成 |\n\n#### 表格规范\n\n```markdown\n# ✅ 正确：完整展示工作成果，不简化\n| 排名 | 规格 | 价格 | 供应商 | 备注 |\n|:---:|------|------|--------|------|\n| 🥇 | 通货 | ¥4.00 | 浙江海盐 | 100斤起 |\n| 🥈 | 冷冻 | ¥6.50 | 1688 | 含冷链 |\n\n# ✅ 排名突出，最优🏆标红\n# ✅ 价格标红加粗\n# ✅ 按价格排序\n```\n\n---\n\n## 三、API调用代码库（1688 / 京东 / 淘宝）\n\n### 3.1 1688 API调用\n\n```python\nimport requests\nimport hashlib\nimport time\nimport json\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\n\n# ========== 配置区 ==========\nAPP_KEY = \"your_1688_appkey\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"your_1688_appsecret\"\n# ============================\n\ndef get_1688_price(keyword, page=1, page_size=20):\n    \"\"\"1688商品搜索与价格查询\"\"\"\n    api_url = \"https://gw.open.1688.com/openapi/param2/1/com.alibaba.product/p4p/searchProductByKeyword\"\n    \n    params = {\n        \"app_key\": APP_KEY,\n        \"method\": \"alibaba.product.p4p.searchProductByKeyword\",\n        \"timestamp\": time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\", time.localtime()),\n        \"format\": \"json\",\n        \"v\": \"2.0\",\n        \"sign_method\": \"md5\",\n        \"keyword\": keyword,\n        \"pageSize\": page_size,\n        \"pageNum\": page\n    }\n    \n    # 生成签名\n    sorted_params = sorted(params.items(), key=lambda x: x[0])\n    sign_str = \"\".join([f\"{k}{v}\" for k, v in sorted_params]) + APP_SECRET\n    sign = hashlib.md5(sign_str.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest().upper()\n    params[\"sign\"] = sign\n    \n    try:\n        response = requests.get(api_url, params=params, timeout=10)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            result = response.json()\n            return parse_1688_result(result)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"1688 API调用失败: {e}\")\n    return None\n\ndef parse_1688_result(result):\n    \"\"\"解析1688返回结果\"\"\"\n    items = []\n    try:\n        products = result.get(\"result\", {}).get(\"products\", [])\n        for p in products:\n            items.append({\n                \"platform\": \"1688\",\n                \"name\": p.get(\"productName\", \"\"),\n                \"price\": p.get(\"price\", \"\"),\n                \"min_order\": p.get(\"minOrderQuantity\", \"\"),\n                \"supplier\": p.get(\"supplierLoginId\", \"\"),\n                \"location\": p.get(\"location\", \"\")\n            })\n    except:\n        pass\n    return items\n```\n\n### 3.2 京东 API调用\n\n```python\nimport requests\nimport hashlib\nimport time\nimport json\n\n# ========== 配置区 ==========\nJD_APP_KEY = \"your_jd_appkey\"\nJD_APP_SECRET = \"your_jd_appsecret\"\n# ============================\n\ndef get_jd_price(sku_id):\n    \"\"\"获取京东商品价格\"\"\"\n    api_url = \"https://api.jd.com/routerjson\"\n    \n    params = {\n        \"app_key\": JD_APP_KEY,\n        \"method\": \"jingdong.item.base.info.get\",\n        \"timestamp\": time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\", time.localtime()),\n        \"format\": \"json\",\n        \"v\": \"2.0\",\n        \"360buy_param_json\": json.dumps({\"skuId\": sku_id})\n    }\n    \n    # 生成签名\n    sorted_params = sorted(params.items(), key=lambda x: x[0])\n    sign_str = \"\".join([f\"{k}{v}\" for k, v in sorted_params]) + JD_APP_SECRET\n    sign = hashlib.md5(sign_str.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest().upper()\n    params[\"sign\"] = sign\n    \n    try:\n        response = requests.get(api_url, params=params, timeout=10)\n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            return response.json()\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"京东API调用失败: {e}\")\n    return None\n\ndef search_jd_products(keyword, page=1):\n    \"\"\"京东商品搜索\"\"\"\n    api_url = \"https://api.jd.com/routerjson\"\n    \n    params = {\n        \"app_key\": JD_APP_KEY,\n        \"method\": \"jingdong.item.search.search\",\n        \"timestamp\": time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\", time.localtime()),\n        \"format\": \"json\",\n        \"v\": \"2.0\",\n        \"360buy_param_json\": json.dumps({\n            \"keyword\": keyword,\n            \"page\": page,\n            \"pageSize\": 20\n        })\n    }\n    \n    # 生成签名\n    sorted_params = sorted(params.items(), key=lambda x: x[0])\n    sign_str = \"\".join([f\"{k}{v}\" for k, v in sorted_params]) + JD_APP_SECRET\n    sign = hashlib.md5(sign_str.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest().upper()\n    params[\"sign\"] = sign\n    \n    try:\n\n[265 more lines in file. Use offset=350 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776407407872}}
{"type":"message","id":"4129caf8","parentId":"af154328","timestamp":"2026-04-17T06:30:36.017Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me now create the update. I need to add a mode selection card as the first interaction when user queries. Let me design it and then update the SKILL.md.\n\nThe key changes:\n1. Add a mode selection card that appears first (before the search progress cards)\n2. Three modes: 询比价 / 成本底线剥离版 / 同步都要\n3. When user selects a mode, proceed with that specific workflow\n\nLet me write the updated SKILL section for the mode selection."},{"type":"text","text":"现在我来更新 SKILL，添加三选一模式选择卡片：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_he1cfs6mox43_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/SKILL.md","edits":[{"oldText":"### 2.2 查询流程：四步曲（必须遵循）\n\n```\n用户发送「查三黄鸡价格」\n    ↓\nStep 1: 立即发送【预热卡片】(0秒)\n    ↓\nStep 2: 发送【进度卡片】(1秒)\n    ↓\nStep 3: 发送【结果卡片】(3-8秒)\n    ↓\nStep 4: 发送【导出确认】(可选)\n```","newText":"### 2.2 查询流程：模式选择 + 四步曲（必须遵循）\n\n```\n用户发送「查三黄鸡价格」\n    ↓\nStep 0: 立即发送【模式选择卡片】(0秒) ← 用户选择查询模式\n    ↓\nStep 1: 发送【预热卡片】(0秒)\n    ↓\nStep 2: 发送【进度卡片】(1秒)\n    ↓\nStep 3: 发送【结果卡片】(3-8秒)\n    ↓\nStep 4: 发送【导出确认】(可选)\n```\n\n### 2.3 【模式选择卡片】- 立即发送（0秒）\n\n用户输入查询关键词后，**立即发送模式选择卡片**，让用户选择查询模式：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n  \"card\": {\n    \"header\": {\n      \"template\": \"purple\",\n      \"title\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🔍 查询模式选择 - 三黄鸡\"}\n    },\n    \"elements\": [\n      {\"tag\": \"markdown\", \"content\": \"**📍 关键词**：三黄鸡 · 宁波地区\\n**请选择查询模式：**\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"divider\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"markdown\", \"content\": \"**🅰️ 询比价（快速）**\\n直接查询1688/京东/淘宝实时价格，3秒出结果\\n✅ 最快 · ✅ 最准 · ✅ 推荐\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"action\", \"actions\": [{\"tag\": \"button\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🅰️ 只查询比价\"}, \"type\": \"primary\", \"value\": \"mode_price\"}]},\n      {\"tag\": \"divider\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"markdown\", \"content\": \"**🅱️ 成本底线剥离版（深度）**\\n在询比价基础上，增加成本结构拆解：\\n🌾 原材料BOM分析\\n💰 人工+制造费用剥离\\n📊 品牌溢价量化\\n输出：采购底线建议价\\n⚠️ 预计耗时：8-15秒\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"action\", \"actions\": [{\"tag\": \"button\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🅱️ 成本底线剥离版\"}, \"type\": \"default\", \"value\": \"mode_cost\"}]},\n      {\"tag\": \"divider\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"markdown\", \"content\": \"**🅾️ 同步都要**\\n同时输出「询比价结果」+「成本底线剥离结果」\\n一份报告，双重价值\\n⚠️ 预计耗时：10-20秒\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"action\", \"actions\": [{\"tag\": \"button\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🅾️ 询比价 + 成本底线\"}, \"type\": \"default\", \"value\": \"mode_both\"}]},\n      {\"tag\": \"divider\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"markdown\", \"content\": \"*💡 提示：成本底线剥离需要AI深度分析，首次使用可能稍慢*\"}\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**交互逻辑**：\n- 用户点击按钮 → 根据 `value` 值执行对应模式\n- `mode_price` → 只执行询比价（当前v7.0流程）\n- `mode_cost` → 只执行成本底线剥离\n- `mode_both` → 先询比价，再成本剥离，最后合并输出\n\n**按钮 value 值映射**：\n| value | 模式 | 执行内容 |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| `mode_price` | 🅰️ 询比价 | 1688/京东/淘宝实时价格查询 |\n| `mode_cost` | 🅱️ 成本底线 | BOM拆解 + 溢价剥离 + 底线建议价 |\n| `mode_both` | 🅾️ 都要 | 询比价 + 成本底线（完整版） |"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776407407931,"responseId":"0631067047e007f405deda58746b346f"}}
