{"type":"message","id":"7b58d72b","parentId":"4cf5e821","timestamp":"2026-04-17T06:33:32.447Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The field for \"更新日期\" is \"更新时间\" (field_id: fldQf4JR8y) and it's a DateTime field. But in my update I used \"更新日期\". Let me try again with the correct field names."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oy5gpttbbd98_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tbly9t1QKK80Ra87","record_id":"recvgVH5xXBkws","fields":{"更新时间":1776382200000,"使用方法":[{"text":"## 部署\ncd ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills\ngit clone https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar.git\n\n## 使用（发送至飞书机器人）\n- 「查价格」/ 「查一下黄瓜价格」/ 「上传报价单」\n\n## 新功能！三模式选择\n用户查询时，会先弹出模式选择卡片：\n- 🅰️ 询比价（快速）：3秒返回1688/京东/淘宝价格\n- 🅱️ 成本底线剥离（深度）：BOM拆解+品牌溢价剥离+采购底线建议价\n- 🅾️ 同步都要：询比价+成本底线完整版（10-20秒）\n\n## 数据源\n- 农产品(9个): 农业农村部、新发地、商务预报、寿光蔬菜、猪价网等\n- 电商(4个): 淘宝、天猫、京东、拼多多、1688\n\n## GitHub\nhttps://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar","type":"text"}],"能力描述":[{"text":"🚀 v8.0重磅升级！三模式支持：①询比价（快速，3秒）②成本底线剥离（BOM拆解+溢价剥离+采购底线建议价）③同步都要（完整版）。AI自动查询农产品批发价、电商零售价，帮助财务/采购/厨房快速核价。19个数据源+一键导出飞书多维表格。","type":"text"}]}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776407597371,"responseId":"0631072db7f1a06daec8b23dcf522915"}}
