{"type":"message","id":"4bd9abf0","parentId":"cf6ab64d","timestamp":"2026-04-17T10:26:32.751Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a different approach - use markdown format instead of interactive card, and explain the card issue."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉，飞书卡片发送遇到格式问题（还在调试中）。\n\n**三模式选择概念演示：**\n\n---\n\n**🔍 查询模式选择 - 三黄鸡**\n\n**请选择查询模式：**\n\n---\n\n**🅰️ 询比价（快速）**\n直接查询1688/京东/淘宝实时价格，3秒出结果\n✅ 最快 · ✅ 最准 · ✅ 推荐\n\n---\n\n**🅱️ 成本底线剥离版（深度）**\n在询比价基础上，增加成本结构拆解：\n🌾 原材料BOM分析\n💰 人工+制造费用剥离\n📊 品牌溢价量化\n⚠️ 预计耗时：8-15秒\n\n---\n\n**🅾️ 同步都要**\n同时输出「询比价结果」+「成本底线剥离结果」\n一份报告，双重价值\n⚠️ 预计耗时：10-20秒\n\n---\n\n卡片格式还在调试，演示效果如上。你希望用这个 Markdown 版本先跑起来，还是等我修好卡片格式？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776421586670,"responseId":"06313dd368a903a18f02fc1cbb4361d5"}}
