{"type":"message","id":"eae423d9","parentId":"984f995c","timestamp":"2026-04-17T10:27:57.608Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that the content parameter should be a STRING, not an object. Looking at the API documentation, the `content` field for interactive messages should be a JSON string. The `feishu_im_user_message` tool takes `content` as a string, but it seems the tool is expecting the content to already be stringified.\n\nWait - looking at the tool definition:\n```\n\"content\": {\"description\": \"消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式取决于 msg_type。示例：text → '{\\\"text\\\":\\\"你好\\\"}', image → '{\\\"image_key\\\":\\\"img_xxx\\\"}', share_chat → '{\\\"chat_id\\\":\\\"oc_xxx\\\"}', post → '{\\\"zh_cn\\\":{\\\"title\\\":\\\"标题\\\",\\\"content\\\":[[{\\\"tag\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"正文\\\"}]]}}'\", \"type\": \"string\"}\n```\n\nSo for `msg_type=interactive`, the content should be a stringified JSON. Let me try again with a properly escaped string."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8ndfkmr4ge6t_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","msg_type":"interactive","content":"{\"msg_type\":\"interactive\",\"card\":{\"header\":{\"template\":\"purple\",\"title\":{\"tag\":\"plain_text\",\"content\":\"测试卡片\"}},\"elements\":[{\"tag\":\"markdown\",\"content\":\"测试内容\"}]}}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776421669936,"responseId":"06313e261f1a934598e94a5355b03c76"}}
