{"type":"message","id":"400fda99","parentId":"b8100a0e","timestamp":"2026-04-17T10:28:15.074Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message tool seems to need a different parameter structure. Let me check the tool definition again. The message tool shows `content` for the content. Let me try a different approach - maybe the content needs to be a string.\n\nActually looking at the feishu_im_user_message tool description again:\n- content: message content (JSON string)\n\nThe content is supposed to be a JSON STRING, not an object. So maybe I need to stringify it again?\n\nWait, the error is \"Failed to create card content\" which is a Feishu API error, not an OpenClaw error. The issue is the card content is invalid.\n\nLet me look at the API doc more carefully. It says for interactive cards, you use `card` field not `content`. Let me look at the tool definition:\n\n```\n\"content\": \"消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式取决于 msg_type。示例：text → '{\\\"text\\\":\\\"你好\\\"}'\"\n```\n\nSo for interactive, content should be a JSON string of the card. But in the tool definition it shows `msg_type: \"interactive\"` and `content: <card json>`.\n\nMaybe the issue is that the card needs to be sent differently. Let me look at the example from search results:\n\n```\n\"card\" :{\n  \"config\":{\n    \"wide_screen_mode\" :true },\n  \"elements\":[\n    {\n      \"tag\": \"div\", \"fields\" :[ {...}]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nSo the `card` field is the card object itself, not inside `content`. But the feishu_im_user_message tool says:\n- msg_type: \"interactive\" \n- content: '{\"tag\": \"div\"...}'\n\nI think the issue is the content should be a STRINGIFIED card JSON, not a raw object. Let me try with actual stringified JSON."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gswi3p6x03rv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import json; card={'msg_type':'interactive','card':{'header':{'template':'purple','title':{'tag':'plain_text','content':'测试卡片'}},'elements':[{'tag':'markdown','content':'测试内容'}]}}; print(json.dumps(card))\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776421683061,"responseId":"06313e335681d2caf5da09b19dea6b55"}}
