{"type":"message","id":"4350bc9a","parentId":"f921198b","timestamp":"2026-04-17T10:29:18.053Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error is \"open_id cross app\" - this means we can't send to a user's open_id directly because the app doesn't have permission. We need to use the user's open_id from the same tenant. Let me check if the feishu_im_user_message tool works differently.\n\nActually, the `feishu_im_user_message` tool works with the user's OAuth context, so it should be able to send as the user. But it's failing with card format errors.\n\nLet me try using the feishu-send-message script but using chat_id approach instead. The user ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 might have a chat_id (P2P chat) we can use."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_srjv6gl8wykz_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\":\"测试：Markdown版本三模式卡片\\n\\n🅰️ 询比价（快速） - 3秒出结果\\n🅱️ 成本底线剥离版 - BOM拆解+溢价剥离\\n🅾️ 同步都要 - 完整版报告\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776421751810,"responseId":"06313e788ba92babf08dd9d2978e8364"}}
