{"type":"message","id":"8ee6ab95","parentId":"01fff0db","timestamp":"2026-04-17T10:29:27.859Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the card format issue is because I'm using `feishu_im_user_message` which is for user identity. The tool seems to have issues with card format validation. The issue is \"open_id cross app\" which means the user identity tool is using a different app context.\n\nLet me just reply to the user and confirm the markdown version works. The SKILL is updated and the markdown version is working. The card format issue needs more investigation."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已发送 Markdown 版本！✅\n\n**目前状态：**\n- ✅ Markdown 版本正常运行\n- ✅ 三模式交互流程已设计好\n- ⚠️ 飞书原生卡片格式还在调试（遇到跨应用 open_id 限制）\n\n**实际使用时会是这样：**\n```\n用户：查三黄鸡价格\nAI：[Markdown三选一模式卡片]\n用户：说\"都要\"或点击选项\nAI：[询比价结果] + [成本底线结果]\n```\n\nSKILL v8.0 已就绪，等卡片调试好后体验更佳！现在可以先试试\"**查三黄鸡价格**\"看看完整流程？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776421759367,"responseId":"06313e7f739f23678d272ae8fb8cd45e"}}
