{"type":"message","id":"41e0a14a","parentId":"8cef2cd3","timestamp":"2026-04-17T14:12:24.899Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"搜索结果显示\"手雷\"主要出现在玩具/道具/模型搜索结果中，没有找到酒店相关的\"手雷\"采购。可能：\n\n1. 用户指的是某种酒店用品的方言/俚语称呼\n2. 用户打错了字\n3. 用户指的是某种特定用品\n\n让我直接问用户确认一下。"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 搜索\"手雷\"主要找到的是玩具/道具类，没找到酒店采购相关的数据。\n\n**请问您指的是哪种\"手雷\"？**\n\n1. 🔋 **某种酒店设备/器材？**（可能是方言或俚语）\n2. ✏️ **可能是打字错误？** 告诉我正确名称\n3. 📋 **某种特定耗材/用品？** 具体是什么用途？\n\n请补充一下信息，我来重新查询 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776435136633,"responseId":"063172c000d8ba42f48247ab3d46582f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"99e7b003","parentId":"41e0a14a","timestamp":"2026-04-17T14:13:50.766Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-17 14:13:48 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b51104f70e0a4c459e954bef7a9d, reply_to:om_x100b5117b2a324acb32a931db2afbcc]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51104f70e0a4c459e954bef7a9d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-17 14:13 UTC\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b5117b2a324acb32a931db2afbcc] <card>\\n搜索\\\"手雷\\\"主要找到的是玩具/道具类，没找到酒店采购相关的数据。\\n\\n**请问您指的是哪种\\\"手雷\\\"？**\\n1. 🔋 **某种酒店设备/器材？**（可能是方言或俚语）\\n2. ✏️ **可能是打字错误？** 告诉我正确名称\\n3. 📋 **某种特定耗材/用品？** 具体是什么用途？请补充一下信息，我来重新查询 🦞\\n</card>\"\n}\n```\n\n军用手雷价格"}],"timestamp":1776435230702}}
