ground: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            color: white;","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776435748765}}
{"type":"message","id":"cfc1c3a6","parentId":"fe926242","timestamp":"2026-04-17T14:23:54.549Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, there's already an index.html. Let me check the full content and see if I need to update it significantly. The user wants:1. A perfect landing page\n2. User manual (使用说明书)\n3. Hotel scenario use case examples (酒店场景使用案例示例)All in HTML, pushed to GitHub Pages.\n\nLet me create a comprehensive landing page that includes:\n1. Hero section with the value proposition\n2. Feature highlights3. Use case examples for hotels\n4. User manual / how to use5. Demo scenarios\n6. Call to action\n\nLet me write a complete, professional HTML landing page."},{"type":"text","text":"已有 index.html，但需要大幅升级！让我重新打造一个完整的落地页+使用手册：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uhnufxx31s9n_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/delonix-procurement-radar/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>🏨 酒店采购比价助手 - 让每一分钱都花在刀刃上</title>\n    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        :root {\n            --primary: #6366f1;\n            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;\n            --success: #10b981;\n            --warning: #f59e0b;\n            --danger: #ef4444;\n            --purple: #8b5cf6;\n            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\n            background: var(--bg-gradient);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            color: #334155;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }\n        \n        /* Header */\n        .header {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 60px 20px 40px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .header h1 {\n            font-size: 2.8em;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        }\n        .header .subtitle {\n            font-size: 1.4em;\n            opacity: 0.95;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        .badges {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 12px;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n        .badge {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: 8px 20px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 0.95em;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n        }\n        \n        /* Card */\n        .card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            padding: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n        }\n        .card h2 {\n            color: #1e293b;\n            font-size: 1.6em;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            padding-bottom: 15px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;\n        }\n        .card h2 .emoji { margin-right: 10px; }\n        \n        /* Hero */\n        .hero-card {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%);\n            color: white;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 50px 40px;\n        }\n        .hero-card h2 {\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            font-size: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .hero-card .desc {\n            font-size: 1.15em;\n            opacity: 0.9;\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n        }\n        .stats {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n        .stat {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n        }\n        .stat .number {\n            font-size: 2.2em;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #fbbf24;\n        }\n        .stat .label {\n            opacity: 0.8;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n        \n        /* Features */\n        .features-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .feature {\n            background: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 25px;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);\n            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n        }\n        .feature:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        }\n        .feature h3 {\n            color: var(--primary);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-size: 1.15em;\n        }\n        .feature p {\n            color: #64748b;\n            font-size: 0.95em;\n        }\n        \n        /* Scenario Cards */\n        .scenario {\n            background: #f8fafc;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n        }\n        .scenario-header {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .scenario-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--bg-gradient);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 1.5em;\n        }\n        .scenario-title {\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            color: #1e293b;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .scenario-subtitle {\n            color: #64748b;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n        .scenario-content {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n        .scenario-content h4 {\n            color: var(--primary);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .chat-demo {\n            background: #1e1b4b;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            color: white;\n            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', monospace;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n        .chat-demo .user { color: #a5b4fc; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n        .chat-demo .ai { color: #86efac; }\n        \n        /* Manual */\n        .manual-step {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        .step-number {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: white;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .step-content h4 {\n            color: #1e293b;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .step-content p {\n            color: #64748b;\n            font-size: 0.95em;\n        }\n        .keyword-tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #e0e7ff;\n            color: var(--primary-dark);\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 0.85em;\n            margin: 3px;\n        }\n        \n        /* Table */\n        .data-table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        .data-table th {\n            background: var(--primary);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 12px 15px;\n            text-align: left;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .data-table td {\n            padding: 12px 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n        }\n        .data-table tr:hover { background: #f8fafc; }\n        .price-highlight { color: var(--success); font-weight: 700; }\n        .price-warn { color: var(--danger); }\n        \n        /* CTA */\n        .cta-section {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 50px 40px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%);\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .cta-section h2 { color: white; border: none; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n        .cta-section p { opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 1.1em; }\n        .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 15px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n        .cta-btn {\n            padding: 15px 35px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n        }\n        .cta-btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n        }\n        .cta-btn.primary { background: white; color: var(--primary-dark); }\n        .cta-btn.secondary { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }\n        \n        /* Footer */\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 40px 20px;\n            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n        \n        /* Responsive */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .header h1 { font-size: 2em; }\n            .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .card { padding: 25px; }\n            .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n        \n        /* Highlight boxes */\n        .highlight-box {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 100%);\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--warning);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n        .success-box {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5 0%, #a7f3d0 100%);\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--success);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;\n            margin: 20px 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>🏨 酒店采购比价助手</h1>\n            <p class=\"subtitle\">Hotel Procurement Radar — 让每一分钱都花在刀刃上</p>\n            <div class=\"badges\">\n                <span class=\"badge\">🚀 全自动</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\">💰 成本底线剥离</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\">📊 实时数据</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\">🔄 自动容灾</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\">📋 导出多维表格</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <!-- Hero -->\n        <div class=\"card hero-card\">\n            <h2>你的专属采购军师</h2>\n            <p class=\"desc\">\n                还在靠\"经验\"定价？还在被供应商忽悠？<br>\n                酒店采购比价助手基于AI，实时查询1688、农业农村部等19个数据源，<br>\n                <strong style=\"color:#fbbf24\">自动计算成本底线</strong>，让虚高报价无处遁形！\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"stats\">\n                <div class=\"stat\">\n                    <div class=\"number\">19+</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">数据源覆盖</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat\">\n                    <div class=\"number\">3秒</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">极速响应</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat\">\n                    <div class=\"number\">30%</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">平均节省</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- 三大模式 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2><span class=\"emoji\">🎯</span>三大查询模式</h2>\n            <div class=\"features-grid\">\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🅰️ 询比价（快速）</h3>\n                    <p>直接查询1688/京东/淘宝实时价格，3秒出结果。适合紧急询价、快速比价。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🅱️ 成本底线剥离（深度）</h3>\n                    <p>AI自动拆解BOM成本结构，剥离品牌溢价，输出采购底线建议价。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🅾️ 同步都要（完整）</h3>\n                    <p>一份报告，双重价值。询比价+成本底线完整版，适合重要采购决策。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- 核心能力 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2><span class=\"emoji\">⚡</span>核心能力</h2>\n            <div class=\"features-grid\">\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🌾 农产品批发价</h3>\n                    <p>农业农村部、新发地、惠农网、一亩田等9个数据源，实时抓取。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🛒 电商平台价</h3>\n                    <p>1688、京东、淘宝、拼多多，实时价格对比，找出最优渠道。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>📊 成本底线计算</h3>\n                    <p>自动拆解BOM成本结构，计算原材料+加工+物流+损耗，得出真实底线。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>⚠️ 风险预警</h3>\n                    <p>自动识别价格异常，当价格超出底线时主动预警，提醒采购注意。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>📋 多维表格导出</h3>\n                    <p>一键导出飞书多维表格，自动创建表格字段，无需手动配置。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"feature\">\n                    <h3>🔄 自动容灾</h3>\n                    <p>主数据源失败自动切换备用，永不掉线，确保查询稳定。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- 酒店场景案例 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2><span class=\"emoji\">🏨</span>酒店场景使用案例</h2>\n            \n            <!-- 案例1 -->\n            <div class=\"scenario\">\n                <div class=\"scenario-header\">\n                    <div class=\"scenario-icon\">🍗</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-title\">案例1：餐饮部三黄鸡采购</div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-subtitle\">厨房食材成本管控</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"scenario-content\">\n                    <h4>💬 对话演示</h4>\n                    <div class=\"chat-demo\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">用户：查一下三黄鸡宁波地区批发价，要成本底线</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">AI：正在查询农业农村部、1688等数据源...</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">📊 查询结果：</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 浙江海盐农户：¥4.00/斤（100斤起）</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 1688冷冻批发：¥6.50~7.00/斤</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 成本底线：¥4.80~5.50/斤</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• ⚠️ 超市零售¥12/斤，溢价超100%！</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"success-box\" style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\n                        <strong>💡 采购建议：</strong>选择1688批发渠道，¥6.50~7.00/斤，接近成本底线。月采购2000斤可节省约¥10,000。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- 案例2 -->\n            <div class=\"scenario\">\n                <div class=\"scenario-header\">\n                    <div class=\"scenario-icon\">🔌</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-title\">案例2：工程部插排采购</div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-subtitle\">五金耗材成本管控</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"scenario-content\">\n                    <h4>💬 对话演示</h4>\n                    <div class=\"chat-demo\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">用户：公牛插排USB五孔3米的成本底线是多少？</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">AI：正在拆解BOM成本结构...</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">📊 成本底线分析：</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 原材料（铜线/塑料/USB模块）：¥22~32</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 加工+包装+物流：¥5~7</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 💰 成本底线：¥27~39/个</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• ⚠️ 京东自营¥75+，溢价90%！</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\n                        <strong>💡 采购建议：</strong>走1688旗舰店批发，¥40~55/个，接近底线。避免京东自营渠道。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- 案例3 -->\n            <div class=\"scenario\">\n                <div class=\"scenario-header\">\n                    <div class=\"scenario-icon\">🧴</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-title\">案例3：客房一次性用品采购</div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-subtitle\">耗品采购成本优化</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"scenario-content\">\n                    <h4>💬 对话演示</h4>\n                    <div class=\"chat-demo\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">用户：洗发水沐浴露套装，500ml的采购价是多少？</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">AI：正在查询1688、惠农网等数据源...</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">📊 比价结果：</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 1688散装批发：¥3.5~5.0/套</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 淘宝零售：¥8~15/套</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 成本底线：¥2.8~4.0/套</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• ✅ 建议采购价：¥4~6/套</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- 案例4 -->\n            <div class=\"scenario\">\n                <div class=\"scenario-header\">\n                    <div class=\"scenario-icon\">💡</div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-title\">案例4：PA清洁剂大批量采购</div>\n                        <div class=\"scenario-subtitle\">清洁用品成本管控</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"scenario-content\">\n                    <h4>💬 对话演示</h4>\n                    <div class=\"chat-demo\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">用户：84消毒液5L装的供应商价格对比</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">AI：正在查询1688、工业品批发平台...</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">📊 比价结果：</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 1688工业装：¥8~12/桶（5L）</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• 超市零售：¥25~35/桶</div>\n                        <div class=\"ai\">• ⚠️ 价差达3倍！建议走批发渠道</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"success-box\" style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\n                        <strong>💡 采购建议：</strong>月用量200桶，从超市切换1688可节省约¥3,400/月。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- 使用手册 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2><span class=\"emoji\">📖</span>使用说明书</h2>\n            \n            <h3 style=\"color:#1e293b;margin:25px 0 15px;\">快速开始（4步上手）</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"manual-step\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n                <div class=\"step-content\">\n                    <h4>添加机器人为好友</h4>\n                    <p>在飞书中找到\"酒店采购比价助手\"，添加为好友或拉入群聊。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"manual-step\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n                <div class=\"step-content\">\n                    <h4>发送关键词触发查询</h4>\n                    <p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">直接发送以下任意指令：</p>\n                    <span class=\"keyword-tag\">查价格</span>\n                    <span class=\"keyword-tag\">查XX价格</span>\n                    <span class=\"keyword-tag\">成本底线</span>\n                    <span class=\"keyword-tag\">采购比价</span>\n                    <span class=\"keyword-tag\">核价</span>\n                    <p style=\"margin-top:10px;\">例如：「查三黄鸡价格」「农夫山泉矿泉水成本底线」</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"manual-step\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n                <div class=\"step-content\">\n                    <h4>选择查询模式</h4>\n                    <p>系统会弹出三选一模式卡片：</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin-top:8px;\">🅰️ <strong>询比价</strong> — 快速返回价格列表</p>\n                    <p>🅱️ <strong>成本底线</strong> — 深度分析成本结构</p>\n                    <p>🅾️ <strong>都要</strong> — 完整报告</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"manual-step\">\n                <div class=\"step-number\">4</div>\n                <div class=\"step-content\">\n                    <h4>查看结果 & 导出</h4>\n                    <p>查看价格对比、成本底线分析，点击按钮<strong>导出到飞书多维表格</strong>存档。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <h3 style=\"color:#1e293b;margin:30px 0 15px;\">支持的品类（持续扩展中）</h3>\n            \n            <table class=\"data-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>品类</th>\n                        <th>示例关键词</th>\n                        <th>数据来源</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🥩 肉类禽蛋</td>\n                        <td>三黄鸡、白条鸡、鸡蛋、鸭肉</td>\n                        <td>农业农村部、惠农网</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🥬 蔬菜水果</td>\n                        <td>黄瓜、西红柿、苹果、香蕉</td>\n                        <td>新发地、惠农网、一亩田</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🛒 五金耗材</td>\n                        <td>插排、灯泡、门锁、插座</td>\n                        <td>1688、京东</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🧴 客房用品</td>\n                        <td>洗发水、沐浴露、拖鞋、纸巾</td>\n                        <td>1688、淘宝</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🍽️ 餐饮用品</td>\n                        <td>一次性餐具、桌布、口布</td>\n                        <td>1688、拼多多</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🧹 清洁用品</td>\n                        <td>84消毒液、洗洁精、洁厕灵</td>\n                        <td>1688、工业品批发</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>🔧 工程材料</td>\n                        <td>电线、管道、阀门、螺丝</td>\n                        <td>1688、京东企业购</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            \n            <h3 style=\"color:#1e293b;margin:30px 0 15px;\">常见问题</h3>\n            \n            <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n                <p><strong>Q: 查不到的数据怎么办？</strong></p>\n                <p>A: 系统会自动尝试多个数据源。如果都失败，会提示您提供参考价格，这些价格会被记录用于后续学习。</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n                <p><strong>Q: 成本底线是怎么算出来的？</strong></p>\n                <p>A: 通过实时查询1688、农业农村部等数据源获取原材料价格，结合行业平均成本系数（加工费、物流费、损耗率等）计算得出。</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n                <p><strong>Q: 如何导出数据到多维表格？</strong></p>\n                <p>A: 查询结果卡片中有「导出到多维表格」按钮，点击后系统会自动创建/追加到您的飞书多维表格。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- 数据源 -->\n        <div class=\"card\">\n            <h2><span class=\"emoji\">📡</span>数据源覆盖</h2>\n            \n            <h3 style=\"color:#1e293b;margin:20px 0 15px;\">农产品数据源（9个）</h3>\n            <table class=\"data-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>数据源</th>\n                        <th>类型</th>\n                        <th>更新频率</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>农业农村部</td>\n                        <td>官方批发价</td>\n                        <td>每日</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>北京新发地</td>\n                        <td>批发市场价</td>\n                        <td>每日</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>惠农网</td>\n                        <td>产地价/实时</td>\n                        <td>实时</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>一亩田</td>\n                        <td>批发市场</td>\n                        <td>每日</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>商务预报</td>\n                        <td>全国均价</td>\n                        <td>每周</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            \n            <h3 style=\"color:#1e293b;margin:25px 0 15px;\">电商数据源（4个）</h3>\n            <table class=\"data-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>平台</th>\n                        <th>类型</th>\n                        <th>说明</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>1688</td>\n                        <td>批发价</td>\n                        <td><span class=\"price-highlight\">推荐采购渠道</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>京东</td>\n                        <td>企业采购价</td>\n                        <td>企业客户价</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>淘宝</td>\n                        <td>零售/批发</td>\n                        <td>参考价</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>拼多多</td>\n                        <td>百亿补贴</td>\n                        <td>特价参考</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- CTA -->\n        <div class=\"cta-section\">\n            <h2>🚀 立即开始使用</h2>\n            <p>添加飞书机器人，发送任意商品关键词即可体验<br>全程免费，开源可用</p>\n            <div class=\"cta-buttons\">\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-procurement-radar\" class=\"cta-btn primary\">📦 GitHub</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"cta-btn secondary\">📖 使用文档</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <p>🏨 酒店采购比价助手 | 德胧AI龙虾军团</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:8px;\">MIT License | 开源免费 | 欢迎Star ⭐</p>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776435748851,"responseId":"06317524753af2cdf917358aca56a962"}}
