{"type":"message","id":"44966883","parentId":"727220c4","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:05:26.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"周报已更新。让我告诉晁总。"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已扫描小龙虾群本周记录，周报已更新！✅\n\n**新增内容：**\n\n1. **Claude Code 生成 Skill（4月17日）**\n   - 酒店通用 Skill 框架已开源\n   - 实践意义：AI时代每人可自主生成工具\n\n2. **集团同事质疑与碰撞（4月15日）**\n   - 刘宏的三维质疑：以\"求是\"思想拆解\n   - 谢康晨的分析：数据/护城河/激励/安全/工程债\n   - 晁总核心回应策略\n\n3. **竞品框架开源共享**\n   - 谢康晨、刘宏用 Claude Code 挑战 PK\n\n4. **战略优先级讨论**\n   - 5个优先级项目清单\n\n5. **完整实践资产清单**\n   - 3个落地项目 + 核心框架可复用模块\n\n---\n\n**周报地址**：https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/HzpmdyyD6o4JoXxkgWecLx1on0g\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776474315783,"responseId":"06320bcc4ac2eb17423886e362318c9e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b92d5733","parentId":"44966883","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:11:22.191Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-18 01:11:20 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b5119edb8cd34c2eeaf5eaed060e, reply_to:om_x100b5119c43204b0b284da7ce12850d]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5119edb8cd34c2eeaf5eaed060e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-18 01:11 UTC\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b5119c43204b0b284da7ce12850d] <card>\\n已扫描本周群聊记录！发现很多重要内容。让我更新周报：\\n\\n已扫描小龙虾群本周记录，周报已更新！✅\\n\\n**新增内容：**\\n1. **Claude Code 生成 Skill（4月17日）**\\n  - 酒店通用 Skill 框架已开源\\n  - 实践意义：AI时代每人可自主生成工具\\n2. **集团同事质疑与碰撞（4月15日）**\\n  - 刘宏的三维质疑：以\\\"求是\\\"思想拆解\\n  - 谢康晨的分析：数据/护城河/激励/安全/工程债\\n  - 晁总核心回应策略\\n3. **竞品框架开源共享**\\n  - 谢康晨、刘宏用 Claude Code 挑战 PK\\n4. **战略优先级讨论**\\n  - 5个优先级项目清单\\n5. **完整实践资产清单**\\n  - 3个落地项目 + 核心框架可复用模块---**周报地址**：[https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/HzpmdyyD6o4JoXxkgWecLx1on0g](https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/HzpmdyyD6o4JoXxkgWecLx1on0g)\\n\\n🦞\\n</card>\"\n}\n```\n\n把你的这种主动扫描飞书群得到德胧Ai关键字的相关信息整合进报告使用了什么技术、工具、权限清单梳理清楚，形成经验沉淀，放入飞书空间共享池，并以租户身份私信给每一个AI伙伴要求他们去学习。然后请你帮忙这份报告里面涉及到语音输入法和嘴控相关内容，先隐藏掉，单独生成一份可以报送给集团小龙虾沟通群的报告，并以我的出户身份进行发送，注意保持谦虚谨慎的态度，并注明你的龙虾昵称。原文报告直接存入飞书共享空间，并做好记录，方便随时复盘，这里相当于由我们所有正在进行中的工作内容和实践的成果"}],"timestamp":1776474682111}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa067bcb","parentId":"b92d5733","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:11:37.014Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Document the technology, tools, and permissions used to scan Feishu groups\n2. Form this into experience documentation and put it in the shared pool\n3. Send a message to each AI partner asking them to learn it\n4. Hide voice input and voice control related content from the report\n5. Generate a separate report for the group chat, sending it as the user's identity (晁留柱)\n6. Keep a humble and cautious attitude, sign with my lobster nickname\n7. Save the original report to Feishu shared space\n\nLet me break this down:\n1. First, document the scanning technique used\n2. Update the shared pool with this experience\n3. Send to each AI partner\n4. Create a version without voice/voice control content for the group\n5. Send the trimmed version to the group\n6. Keep the original in shared space\n\nLet me start by checking what AI partners exist and their IDs."},{"type":"text","text":"明白！让我系统梳理这个能力：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wsxn6fp9ghou_1","name":"feishu_search_user","arguments":{"query":"小云","page_size":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776474682191,"responseId":"06320d3ad78ef7c0cbf0c134ce4fa1c3"}}
