{"type":"message","id":"194168d4","parentId":"7dd6f6c9","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:12:52.254Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to send this report to the 小龙虾沟通群 (oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8) from the user's identity. Let me use feishu_im_user_message to send it."},{"type":"text","text":"现在发送报告到小龙虾群：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mrc4mne48pqo_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"chat_id","receive_id":"oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\":\"各位同事好！本周德胧AI实践周报已整理完成，供大家交流参考。\\n\\n**【德胧AI实践周报·精简版】**\\n\\n本周主要推进了两个工具的落地：\\n\\n1. **竞品价格监控** — 已在天津瑞湾验证，自动每日6点推送\\n2. **采购比价助手 v9.0** — 支持成本底线分析，已开源\\n\\n感谢刘宏、谢康晨等同事提出的宝贵意见，帮助我们更客观地评估进展。\\n\\n详细报告（含技术方案）已存入飞书共享空间，感兴趣的同事可以查看。\\n\\n欢迎大家多提意见，共同完善！\\n\\n—— 小柱\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776474754551,"responseId":"06320d82d661bc3a177e1ac8d588e406"}}
