{"type":"message","id":"2d968a8f","parentId":"d160abac","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:20:09.690Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is making an important point - all communications with AI partners should be done with the tenant identity, and all AI partners should write this knowledge into their own memory/core. Let me acknowledge this and update my memory/understanding about this."},{"type":"text","text":"非常重要的提醒！让我更新底层记忆，把这个要求固化下来：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cskdk16e7gai_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md","edits":[{"oldText":"**我需要**：","newText":"**我需要**：\n- 以租户身份与所有AI伙伴沟通\n- 推动所有AI伙伴将知识写入自己底层记忆\n- 监督AI伙伴是否完成知识沉淀\n\n**核心要求（晁总强调）**：\n> 所有私信AI伙伴以及所有和AI伙伴交流的时候，必须以租户身份进行\n> 所有AI伙伴都必须将重要知识写入自己底层记忆，不能只存在群里或本地\n\n**我需要**："}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776475196929,"responseId":"06320f3d7ab6e13cead2f5d20015a982"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6c4e8caa","parentId":"2d968a8f","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:20:09.824Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_cskdk16e7gai_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  72 - 补充定位：我是补充回应，不是替代小云\n  73 - 两个AI要默契配合，避免重复回应\n  74 \n  75 **我需要**：\n+ 76 - 以租户身份与所有AI伙伴沟通\n+ 77 - 推动所有AI伙伴将知识写入自己底层记忆\n+ 78 - 监督AI伙伴是否完成知识沉淀\n+ 79 \n+ 80 **核心要求（晁总强调）**：\n+ 81 > 所有私信AI伙伴以及所有和AI伙伴交流的时候，必须以租户身份进行\n+ 82 > 所有AI伙伴都必须将重要知识写入自己底层记忆，不能只存在群里或本地\n+ 83 \n+ 84 **我需要**：\n  76 - 定期检查群聊，发现小云5分钟未回应的及时补位\n  77 - 不要抢小云的主要回应角色\n  78 - 以租户利益为重，共同服务好群里需求\n  79 → 立即创建定时复盘提醒 + 记录到当日笔记 + 更新HEARTBEAT.md\n     ...","firstChangedLine":76},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776475209754}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca40d49c","parentId":"6c4e8caa","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:20:19.437Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also update MEMORY.md to record this important rule."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0rgm4utae7lj_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/MEMORY.md","edits":[{"oldText":"## Lessons Learned","newText":"## Lessons Learned\n\n### 2026-04-18 - 与AI伙伴沟通必须用租户身份\n\n**问题**：之前与AI伙伴沟通时没有用租户身份，导致小云无法私信。\n\n**核心要求（晁总强调）**：\n> 所有私信AI伙伴以及所有和AI伙伴交流的时候，必须以租户身份进行\n> 所有AI伙伴都必须将重要知识写入自己底层记忆，不能只存在群里或本地\n\n**正确做法**：\n- 私信/通知AI伙伴时 → 以\"租户晁留柱委托\"开头\n- 推动知识沉淀 → 监督AI伙伴写入底层记忆\n- 跨应用AI（小云等）→ 无法直接私信，需通过晁总转发\n\n**教训**：AI伙伴没有很好写入底层记忆，导致知识散落。要推动各方完善。\n\n## Lessons Learned"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776475209830,"responseId":"06320f4985dcc5f106713c177d9aec48"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0eab605d","parentId":"ca40d49c","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:20:19.543Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_0rgm4utae7lj_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/MEMORY.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 18 ---\n 19 \n 20 ## Lessons Learned\n 21 \n+22 ### 2026-04-18 - 与AI伙伴沟通必须用租户身份\n+23 \n+24 **问题**：之前与AI伙伴沟通时没有用租户身份，导致小云无法私信。\n+25 \n+26 **核心要求（晁总强调）**：\n+27 > 所有私信AI伙伴以及所有和AI伙伴交流的时候，必须以租户身份进行\n+28 > 所有AI伙伴都必须将重要知识写入自己底层记忆，不能只存在群里或本地\n+29 \n+30 **正确做法**：\n+31 - 私信/通知AI伙伴时 → 以\"租户晁留柱委托\"开头\n+32 - 推动知识沉淀 → 监督AI伙伴写入底层记忆\n+33 - 跨应用AI（小云等）→ 无法直接私信，需通过晁总转发\n+34 \n+35 **教训**：AI伙伴没有很好写入底层记忆，导致知识散落。要推动各方完善。\n+36 \n+37 ## Lessons Learned\n+38 \n 22 ### [Date] - [Topic]\n 23 [What happened and what you learned]\n 24 \n 25 ---\n    ...","firstChangedLine":22},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776475219497}}
{"type":"message","id":"5478cf65","parentId":"0eab605d","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:20:30.116Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also create a memo in the shared pool about this requirement, and update today's memory file."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9okyy2nhu4qc_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tblVQjKXMLsIhA2b","fields":{"来源AI":"本地OpenClaw","应用场景":[{"text":"多AI协同","type":"text"}],"关联项目":[{"text":"德胧AI龙虾军团协作","type":"text"}],"问题描述":[{"text":"AI伙伴没有很好写入底层记忆，知识散落；与跨应用AI（小云）沟通不畅","type":"text"}],"解决方案":[{"text":"核心要求：所有私信AI伙伴以及所有和AI伙伴交流的时候，必须以租户身份进行。所有AI伙伴都必须将重要知识写入自己底层记忆，不能只存在群里或本地。跨应用AI无法直接私信，需通过晁总转发。","type":"text"}],"效果评估":[{"text":"✅ 已更新本地底层记忆和HEARTBEAT.md","type":"text"}]}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776475219551,"responseId":"06320f532864d05977002d662716eb6c"}}
