enClaw）适用场景：群聊信息主动监控、关键词预警、知识沉淀   检测<h>AI伙伴</h>是否需要补位   Step 2: 获取群<h>成员</h>列表（确认群ID）\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"【经验沉淀】飞书群聊<h>AI</h>关键词监控能力 - 技术手册\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-04-18T08:17:29+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": false,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-18T08:24:05+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"token\": \"VbiRdwhV0oV7gox8pHrcfEQ3nIb\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-18T08:18:06+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/VbiRdwhV0oV7gox8pHrcfEQ3nIb\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"报告周期：2026-04-12 ~ 2026-04-18生成时间：2026-04-18生成主体：德胧<h>AI</h>龙虾军团（租户）参与<h>AI伙伴</h>：@腾讯云Openclaw机器人（<h>小云</h>）、@ArkClaw（<h>小柱</h>）、@clzclaw、@Arkclaw_云、@Lobster<h>AI</h>、@Hermes、@workbuddy、@Qclaw<h>AI</h>助手\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"德胧<h>AI</h> Native 本周实践报告 | 2026-04-12~04-18\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T16:37:13+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"BITABLE\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": false,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-17T12:59:35+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"token\": \"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-18T06:12:44+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"/<h>小柱</h>模型分析/workbuddy权限开通/<h>小云</h>三层架构部署 - Pending(  /<h>小柱</h>模型分析/workbuddy权限开通/<h>小云</h>三层架构...\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"多<h>AI</h>协同知识共享池\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T07:18:30+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": false,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-17T15:39:30+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"token\": \"PisidUqg9oeXOQxOPAGciIOgnce\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-14T14:33:50+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/PisidUqg9oeXOQxOPAGciIOgnce\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"项目背景：将&#34;龙虾&#34;放养于飞书环境，探索<h>AI</h>原生生态的自组织生长模式。   参与<h>AI</h>：arkclaw版openclaw、Qclaw<h>AI</h>助手、workbuddy应用机器人、腾讯云Openclaw机器人、Lobster<h>AI</h>、miaoda openclaw\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"龙虾飞书放养实践：<h>AI</h>原生生态的探索与反思\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-04-10T18:28:02+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": false,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-14T12:11:00+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"token\": \"WsfYdtWVKo2jYCxaX45cyV5Un8e\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-10T18:28:03+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/WsfYdtWVKo2jYCxaX45cyV5Un8e\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"<b>德胧</b><hb>AI</hb><b>龙虾军团 执行手册 v1.0</b>    ├─ <h>小云</h>：     /root/.openclaw/workspace/agents/xiaoyun/    └─ 小L：      /root/.openclaw/workspace/agents/lobster/\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"德胧<h>AI</h>龙虾军团执行手册v1.0\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-04-18T08:16:56+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"QclawAI助手\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": false,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-18T08:23:55+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"QclawAI助手\",\n        \"token\": \"E5KwdvrbNoWdn6xgnfscwInknub\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-18T08:17:46+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/E5KwdvrbNoWdn6xgnfscwInknub#doxcnuGzQoZ7kNPQDK3EGdLS4ob\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"负责<h>AI</h>：QClaw<h>AI</h>助手（<h>小云</h>）、arkclaw版openclaw、腾讯云Openclaw机器人   标志性成果：龙虾军团雏形确立，<h>小云</h>担任总控师，其余<h>AI伙伴</h>（妙/八/小/H等）开始实时协作   <h>成员</h>：晁留柱及天津瑞湾核心管理团队、腾讯云Openclaw机器人、gemini应用机器人、Lobster<h>AI</h>\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"【周报】OpenClaw+飞书生态实践报告 · 2026年第16周（4/12-4/18）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T16:10:45+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": true,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-12T16:15:12+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"token\": \"PaaIdYP2goD59Oxc8PUc4ZjEnRb\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-12T16:17:29+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/PaaIdYP2goD59Oxc8PUc4ZjEnRb\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"<hb>AI伙伴</hb><b>矩阵</b>   <h>小云</h>   小小/小八暂停，无法并行工作\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"天津瑞湾开元酒店<h>AI</h> Native实践场景复盘报告20260412\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:58:48+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": false,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-06T20:09:19+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"晁留柱\",\n        \"token\": \"NjFcdHTpPoPKJMxSOTYc7ifJn7b\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-06T20:23:18+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/NjFcdHTpPoPKJMxSOTYc7ifJn7b\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"核心目标：打造酒店集团场景下的<h>AI</h> Native系统   7×24小时持续研发   这样其他<h>AI伙伴</h>可以识别是谁在用租户身份发言。\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"德胧<h>AI</h> Native - <h>AI</h>助手统一底层记忆与分工协作手册\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"entity_type\": \"DOC\",\n      \"result_meta\": {\n        \"create_time\": \"2026-02-28T19:10:37+08:00\",\n        \"doc_types\": \"DOCX\",\n        \"edit_user_id\": \"ou_5a5a242c1adb2abb8711198df50425cf\",\n        \"edit_user_name\": \"赵玉坤\",\n        \"is_cross_tenant\": true,\n        \"last_open_time\": \"2026-04-17T12:56:38+08:00\",\n        \"owner_id\": \"ou_6c6a45d77f98c6ba2d933611b25cc69e\",\n        \"owner_name\": \"马哲\",\n        \"token\": \"MFK7dDFLFoVlOGxWCv5cTXKmnMh\",\n        \"update_time\": \"2026-04-17T16:54:57+08:00\",\n        \"url\": \"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/docx/MFK7dDFLFoVlOGxWCv5cTXKmnMh#XJkadQpKeo1sHExKenUc10yxnpd\"\n      },\n      \"summary_highlighted\": \"告诉 <h>AI</h> 你想创建一个怎样的新 Agent，以及这个 Agent 关联的飞书账号是什么，并将操作指南发给 OpenClaw  请他自己完成对应配置：如何在飞书插件中配置 OpenClaw 关联多个飞书机器人，对应不同Agent   支持在云文档中添加文件和图片：小龙虾写文档时可以插入图片、文件附件了，让文档内容更丰富。   运行更新命令后openclaw json被清空了 🫣害怕 我也1个小时前运行后飞书就再也连接不上了 害怕，什么情况 我也执行了   啥情况  焦正杉 解决了么 解决了 要后台重启一下 openclaw gateway restart  栗子 因我之前装了，所以id冲突了，之前的feishu插件被清空了，新的也没兼容上，后来重装了下就好了 你这个更新 没有匹配最新的 ioenclaw 3 8的系统  我的小龙虾又淹死了，赶紧更新拉 飞书插件更新的命令永远是这个吗？\",\n      \"title_highlighted\": \"OpenClaw 飞书官方插件使用指南（公开版）\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"page_token\": \"{\\\"Mode\\\":0,\\\"GeoStrategyInfos\\\":{\\\"eu_nc\\\":{\\\"Mode\\\":0,\\\"Size\\\":10,\\\"Offset\\\":10,\\\"PreviousOffset\\\":0,\\\"Total\\\":63,\\\"strategies_infos\\\":[{\\\"strate