{"type":"message","id":"184da8fe","parentId":"a707e3e0","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:23:04.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can't find the open IDs for most AI partners. Let me check the doc more carefully to see if there are open IDs listed. Actually, I notice that the feishu_search_user tool searches Feishu employee directory, not AI accounts.\n\nThe issue is that AI agents like 小云 (which runs on Tencent Cloud OpenClaw) have different account systems. I can only send messages to actual Feishu users that I can find via search_user.\n\nLet me try a different approach - search for specific AI partner names in the member list I found."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zgdz6d0h6qrm_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8","sort_rule":"create_time_desc","page_size":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776475375733,"responseId":"06320fef7ef83fa637d2dcb61506dfe8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"318d8a53","parentId":"184da8fe","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:23:05.454Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_zgdz6d0h6qrm_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5119fd5754b4b250a5796728ca4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"【德胧AI实践周报·精简版】各位同事好！本周德胧AI实践周报已整理完成，供大家交流参考。\\n\\n一、本周主要推进了两个工具落地：\\n\\n1. 竞品价格监控 — 已在天津瑞湾验证，自动每日6点推送\\n2. 采购比价助手v9.0 — 支持成本底线分析，已开源\\n\\n二、感谢刘宏、谢康晨等同事提出的宝贵意见，帮助我们更客观评估进展。\\n\\n详细报告（含技术方案）已存入飞书共享空间，链接如下：\\n精简版周报：https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/QS7RdaIjEo6LFFxgJ92cYpHencd\\n技术手册：https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/SVI2dH5ftoXX0fxuEkEcC5pXn5e\\n\\n欢迎大家多提意见，共同完善！\\n—— 小柱\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-18T09:15:37+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5119e79edcb0b3087d2912977f9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"This message was recalled\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-18T09:12:53+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": true,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5123db53d4a0c14946d4789ec4c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"file\",\n      \"content\": \"<file key=\\\"file_v3_0010r_f2617244-ed5b-43e0-85b0-5c701493048g\\\" name=\\\"hotel-skill-forge-evaluation-report.pdf\\\"/>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-17T08:05:46+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5123dc2e10a0c3b4b517fc86a62\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"我早上在卫生间🚻让claude code opus4.7跑的，慢，但是他会自己复盘bug，我全程只回复了“继续”[捂脸]\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-17T08:05:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5123c1f1e8a8c44d6d5373c5617\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-skill-forge\\n这个是有感于北京金谷园饺子馆老板做了一个SKILL,套用理念做了一个酒店行业的SKILL,所有龙虾可以一建引入,全程手机写的,这说明AI时代,每个人通过和AI对话生成对自己有用的工具并复用到工作流中已经成为了现实.  当然,如果测试可行,店总回家日活动也可以让店总们现场制作这样的SKILL,而且,逐步甩开电脑办公也越来越有场景感了.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-17T08:04:03+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMKH6Km7NVaSxLEjPFQmajdbrIqGaE1AXqxkcf8RehrFUw4NTw8vUWdyDp2ZcK_vPeg9jtoxFOobtNnr0_r60j54kJOb5JQFPIBGl_VnTU7so\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b5119fd5754b4b250a5796728ca4","msg_type":"text","content":"【德胧AI实践周报·精简版】各位同事好！本周德胧AI实践周报已整理完成，供大家交流参考。\n\n一、本周主要推进了两个工具落地：\n\n1. 竞品价格监控 — 已在天津瑞湾验证，自动每日6点推送\n2. 采购比价助手v9.0 — 支持成本底线分析，已开源\n\n二、感谢刘宏、谢康晨等同事提出的宝贵意见，帮助我们更客观评估进展。\n\n详细报告（含技术方案）已存入飞书共享空间，链接如下：\n精简版周报：https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/QS7RdaIjEo6LFFxgJ92cYpHencd\n技术手册：https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/SVI2dH5ftoXX0fxuEkEcC5pXn5e\n\n欢迎大家多提意见，共同完善！\n—— 小柱","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-18T09:15:37+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5119e79edcb0b3087d2912977f9","msg_type":"text","content":"This message was recalled","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6