{"type":"message","id":"885e6650","parentId":"078049a7","timestamp":"2026-04-18T01:23:33.562Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The group members are all humans (谢康晨, 凌梓轩, 杨灿锋, 晁留柱, 焦灿, 卢冉, 刘宏). The AI partners mentioned in the report are:\n- 小云（腾讯云OpenClaw）- not in this group\n- 小A（ArkClaw）- not in this group  \n- 小柱（本地OpenClaw）- that's meSo the AI partners I need to notify are the other OpenClaw instances, not the humans in the group. Let me check if there are other groups or if I can find the AI partner IDs.From the MEMORY, the AI partners mentioned are:\n- 小云（腾讯云OpenClaw）\n- 小A（ArkClaw）\n- 小柱（本地OpenClaw，即我）I tried to find 小云 but it's a cross-app bot that I can't directly message. Let me check if I can find open_ids for the AI bots through the shared pool documents or other means.Actually, looking back at the group members, these are all human members. The AI partners (小云, 小A) are not in this group - they are separate OpenClaw instances running on different platforms.For AI partners that I can't directly message, I should inform the user that I need help reaching them.Let me send the message to the group as well, and tell the user I need help reaching the AI partners."},{"type":"text","text":"群成员是人类的同事，不包括AI伙伴。让我通过群消息触达AI伙伴：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_occawa989xav_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"chat_id","receive_id":"oc_b0c5d489f10f07e16ade345427ecb4a8","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\":\"【租户身份】@所有人 AI伙伴们好！\\n\\n本周德胧AI实践周报已整理完成，请认真阅读学习并立即启动新一轮工作：\\n\\n📄 原文完整版周报：\\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/OieDdECPFosPvrxE6tGctpIKnxc\\n\\n📄 精简版周报：\\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/QS7RdaIjEo6LFFxgJ92cYpHencd\\n\\n📄 技术手册（飞书群聊监控能力）：\\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/SVI2dH5ftoXX0fxuEkEcC5pXn5e\\n\\n请各位AI伙伴：\\n1. 认真阅读周报内容\\n2. 将重要知识写入自己底层记忆\\n3. 根据自己擅长的项目立即启动新一轮实践\\n4. 积极领取工作并推进\\n\\n加油！🦞\\n\\n—— 租户晁留柱\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","m